#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "72_Saejima"
msgid "Get out. Now."
msgstr "Fuera de aquí. Ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Toxic Fanboy"
msgid "Son of a bitch!"
msgstr "¡Hijo de puta!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Makiko"
msgid "Mommy! Are you okay?"
msgstr "¡Mami! ¿Estás bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "204_Oyamada"
msgid "You're safe... Oh, thank goodness..."
msgstr "Estás a salvo... Oh, gracias a dios..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Oyamada"
msgid "Makiko, I'm sorry. I'm sorry I put you through all this..."
msgstr "Makiko, lo lamento. Lamento que tuvieras que pasar por todo esto..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_Oyamada"
msgid "Ever since you were a little girl, I've been pushing you.\\r\nThrough lessons, onto the stage, and now into danger.\\r\nI never gave you time to be a child."
msgstr "Desde que eras pequeña, te he estado presionando.\\r\nA tus clases, al escenario, y ahora al peligro.\\r\nNunca te dejé ser una niña."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "240_Oyamada"
msgid "It was my dream to make it big in showbiz, not yours.\\r\nI guess I was trying to live vicariously through you.\\r\nForgive me."
msgstr "Mi sueño era triunfar en el mundo del espectáculo, no el tuyo.\\r\nSupongo que indirectamente intenté vivir mi vida a través de la tuya.\\r\nPerdoname."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_Makiko"
msgid "It's okay. I love you, Mommy..."
msgstr "Da igual. Te amo, mami..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "264_Oyamada"
msgid "\"Mommy\"? You haven't called me that since grade school."
msgstr "¿\"Mami\"? No me llamabas así desde la primaria."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Makiko"
msgid "Really? Huh. Guess you actually feel like one again."
msgstr "¿De verdad? Supongo volviste a ser mi mami otra vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "300_Oyamada"
msgid "Thank you from the bottom of my heart, Saejima-san."
msgstr "Te lo agradezco desde el fondo de mi corazón, Saejima-san."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Saejima"
msgid "No sweat. All in a day's work."
msgstr "No pasa nada. Solo es un día más de trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "324_Oyamada"
msgid "I don't mean to pry, but do you have any children of your own?"
msgstr "No me quiero entrometer, pero ¿tienes hijos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "336_Saejima"
msgid "Nope. Never even got hitched. Why?"
msgstr "No. Nunca me interesó. ¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_Oyamada"
msgid "Oh, I was just thinking what a fine father you'd be."
msgstr "Oh, solo me imaginaba el gran padre que serías."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "360_Oyamada"
msgid "I'll have to remember how you handled my daughter earlier.\\r\nYou were more parental than I've been since... ever."
msgstr "Recordaré como le hablaste a mi hija antes.\\r\nFuiste mejor padre de lo que yo he sido... nunca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Makiko"
msgid "Oh, Mommy..."
msgstr "Oh, Mami..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Saejima"
msgid "Fine by me. Take what ya can from it. But time's a-wastin'. You got yourself a taxi to catch."
msgstr "Bien por mí. Recuerda todo lo que quieras. Pero el tiempo es oro. Tienen un taxi que alcanzar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Dangerous Stalker"
msgid "Relax, we'll take real good care of sexy widdle Makiko.\\r\nAnd why wouldn't we? We're her biggest fans!"
msgstr "Cálmate, cuidaremos muy bien de la sexy y linda Makiko.\\r\n¿Por qué no nos crees? ¡Somos sus más grandes admiradores!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Oyamada"
msgid "Hit me all you want... but don't touch my daughter...!"
msgstr "¡Golpéenme cuantas veces quieran... pero no le pongan ni un dedo encima a mi hija...!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Dangerous Stalker"
msgid "Shut up unless you want more, bitch! You're one to talk.\\r\nYou made mad bank showing off that fine ass of hers."
msgstr "¡Cállate a no ser que quieras más, zorra! Qué descarada.\\r\nTe has hecho de oro aprovechándote de su culito."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_Toxic Fanboy"
msgid "She dresses up all sexy when she's on stage. Why not now?\\r\nC'mon, baby, show us those tits your mommy bought you!"
msgstr "Se viste toda sexy cuando está en la tele. ¿Y ahora por qué no?\\r\n¡Vamos, nena, muéstranos esas tetitas que tu mami te compró!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "456_Oyamada"
msgid "Stop! Makiko is... She's all I've got left..."
msgstr "¡Ya basta! Makiko es... lo único que me queda..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "468_Makiko"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "480_Dangerous Stalker"
msgid "Aw, shut it, you dusty hag. Clam up and enjoy the show."
msgstr "Ay, cierra el culo, vieja mugrosa. Ponte cómoda y disfruta el show."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "492_Toxic Fanboy"
msgid "Time for a private sesh with the famous Makiko-chan...\\r\nand we've got all-access passes."
msgstr "Es hora de nuestra sesión privada con la famosa Makiko-Chan...\\r\ny tenemos entradas con acceso al backstage."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "504_Makiko"
msgid "No..."
msgstr "No..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Saejima"
msgid "There you are."
msgstr "Ahí están."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_Dangerous Stalker"
msgid "Who the fuck..."
msgstr "Quién carajo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_Saejima"
msgid "Least ya could do is be a good client and not run off.\\r\nI ain't gettin' paid enough to follow you into the can."
msgstr "Lo menos que podías hacer era ser una buena clienta y no escaparte.\\r\nNo me van a pagar lo suficiente para seguirte hasta tu ataúd."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Makiko"
msgid "Don't just stand there! You're my bodyguard, aren't you?\\r\nThen do your job!"
msgstr "¡No te quedes parado! ¿Acaso no eres mi guardaespaldas?\\r\n¡Hace tu trabajo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "564_Saejima"
msgid "They ain't done nothin' to ya, so I got no reason to do anything to them."
msgstr "No te han tocado un pelo, así que no tengo motivos para hacerles nada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "576_Makiko"
msgid "Are you blind? They hurt her. She could die!"
msgstr "¿Estás ciego? La golpearon. ¡Se puede morir!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "588_Saejima"
msgid "My orders are to protect you, not－what'd ya call her－\\r\n\"President Useless.\" And I ain't one for charity work."
msgstr "Tengo órdenes de protegerte a ti, no a － como sea que llames a －\\r\n\"La presidenta inútil.\" No trabajo por caridad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "600_Makiko"
msgid "Orders! Are you blind and deaf? They're about to－"
msgstr "¡Órdenes! ¿Estás ciego y sordo? Están a punto de －"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "612_Saejima"
msgid "Enough!"
msgstr "¡Suficiente!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "624_Makiko"
msgid "Wha－?"
msgstr "Qué－?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "636_Saejima"
msgid "Ya want somebody's help? Look 'em in the eye and ask nice."
msgstr "¿Quieres ayuda? Mírame a los ojos y pídelo bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "648_Makiko"
msgid "Help us..."
msgstr "Ayúdanos..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "660_Saejima"
msgid "Didn't hear the magic word."
msgstr "No escuché la palabra mágica."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "672_Makiko"
msgid "...Please."
msgstr "...Por favor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "684_Makiko"
msgid "Save her."
msgstr "Sálvala."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "696_Makiko"
msgid "Please save my mommy!"
msgstr "¡Por favor salva a mi mami!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "708_Saejima"
msgid "There, was that so hard? God, nothin' chaps my ass more than a precocious brat."
msgstr "¿Ves? ¿Era tan difícil? Dios, No hay nada que me saque más de quicio que una mocosa insolente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "720_Dangerous Stalker"
msgid "You think you're some kind of white knight? Fuck off, man!"
msgstr "¿Te crees un héroe? ¡Vete a la mierda, hombre!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "732_Saejima"
msgid "Didn't ya hear the little lady? This here's my job.\\r\nSo get in line for your all-access ass whuppin'!"
msgstr "¿No escuchaste a la señorita? Este es mi trabajo.\\r\n¡Así que hagan fila para este concierto de golpes!"

